{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start from scratch in a peaceful village.</strong><br>Grow your own food, sell your products, buy your car and become part of a close-knit community. Build friendships, fall in love with a village girl, and start a family. Live a simple, fulfilling life surrounded by nature.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Drive your car </strong>freely through fields, forests, and village roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.poster.avif?t=1756745046\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.webm?t=1756745046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/a708f26474df7312c197ae03e156a5b1.mp4?t=1756745046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3eDig the Soil then Start Planting</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.poster.avif?t=1756745046\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.webm?t=1756745046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/4dd9de57203e853c778022a8feb584d8.mp4?t=1756745046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Plant and grow</strong> crops across seasons \u2013 from seeding to harvest. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.poster.avif?t=1756745046\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.webm?t=1756745046\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3807510/extras/5eba589daca0975e7459ffe16aa8d859.mp4?t=1756745046\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udee0\ufe0f Coming <strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\ude9c <strong>Free Driving</strong> \u2013 Hop in your car and freely explore your surroundings: lush forests, quiet fields, and the village roads.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Farming from Scratch</strong> \u2013 Start with just a few seeds and grow your farm into a thriving business.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddd1\u200d\ud83c\udf3e <strong>Land Preparation</strong> \u2013 Dig, water, and fertilize your soil to ensure maximum yield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc95 <strong>Relationship</strong>\u2013 Befriend villagers and build meaningful relationships. Some may even lead to romance and family life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\uded2 <strong>Village Economy</strong> \u2013 Sell your harvest, fish goods, and fish at the local market to earn coins and grow your farm.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc6 <strong>Dynamic World</strong> \u2013 Experience changing weather, a day-night cycle, and seasonal events that bring the village to life.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807510?t=1756745046","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3807510?t=1756745046","capsule_image":